SG-RIFE ComfyUI integration

The architecture incorporates ideas from:

- SG-RIFE: Semantic-Guided Real-Time Intermediate Flow Estimation with Diffusion-Competitive Perceptual Quality
  Pan Ben Wong, Chengli Wu, Hanyue Lu
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.18241

- RIFE: Real-Time Intermediate Flow Estimation for Video Frame Interpolation
  Zhewei Huang, Tianyuan Zhang, Wen Heng, Boxin Shi, Shuchang Zhou
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2011.06294

- Dino U-Net: Exploiting High-Fidelity Dense Features from Foundation Models for
  Medical Image Segmentation
  https://github.com/yifangao112/DinoUNet

DINOv3 source code and weights are not included. Users must obtain them separately
and comply with Meta's DINOv3 License Agreement. SG-RIFE and DINO checkpoint weights
are also not included in this repository.
